**GM** — *as Calmer, praising his new spell*
> "Alright."

**GM** — *as Calmer*
> "Calmer says, this new spell of mine is very effective."

**Zinnia** — *checking the creature’s condition*
> "Is he still held?"

**GM** — *confirming*
> "Oh, yes, he is, he's still held."

**Zinnia** — *attacking again*
> "Okay, I'll attack him. How much, how much, how many hit points do you have left?"

**GM** — *giving the remaining hit points*
> "70."

**Zinnia** — *reporting damage*
> "32 points of damage."

**Zinnia** — *declining another focus point*
> "Well, I won't do a focus point. I'll end there."

**GM** — *suggesting withdrawal from melee range*
> "Alright, are you gonna stay there? You can move away from it."

**Zinnia** — *moving away*
> "I'll move away."

**GM** — *calling Zephyr’s turn*
> "Because I can't actually move. Alright, zephyr, you're up."

**Zephyr** — *predicting the kill*
> "This is when he dies."

**Sequoia** — *wanting another chance to attack*
> "Well, I need to get, like, one more attack in of…"

**Zephyr** — *attacking*
> "I attack… I… Hit."

**Zephyr** — *checking sneak attack*
> "It's… this is… Sneaker tag? Bonus?"

**GM** — *confirming*
> "Yeah, but no, yeah, sneak attack, bro."

**Zephyr** — *checking whether the hit still crits*
> "No crit?"

**GM** — *confirming continued paralysis*
> "Crit, still crit. He's paralyzed."

**Zephyr** — *reporting the final damage*
> "57."

**GM** — *announcing the kill*
> "Alright, the creature dies."

**Sequoia** — *reacting*
> "Bruh…"

**GM** — *describing Calmer’s satisfaction*
> "Calmer… Calmer is very pleased with himself."

**GM** — *describing the party leaving the fire to burn*
> "the… you step outside, allow the room to burn to the ground. Okay."

**GM** — *giving the duration and asking whether they leave*
> "It will take a few hours. In the meantime… so now there's this big blaze over there burning. Do you want to walk away and let it burn away?"

**GM** — *assuring them the fire will remain contained*
> "No, no, no, it's… it's… it'll just stay there."

**Zephyr** — *agreeing to leave*
> "Okay, yeah, let's walk away in consolidated territory."
